===============================================================================
Noto Sans CJK JP — pan-CJK font (Adobe and Google)
===============================================================================

`crates/render-pdf/assets/NotoSansCJK-subset.otf` is a subset of Noto Sans CJK
JP (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk), embedded in `chordsketch-render-pdf`
and so in every binary that renders a PDF. Characters outside Latin-1 (CJK,
Greek, Cyrillic) are drawn with it.

Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/).

This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
The license is copied in `crates/render-pdf/assets/OFL.txt` and is available
with a FAQ at: https://openfontlicense.org

The file is a subset of the upstream font, which makes it a Modified Version
in the license's terms. It keeps the upstream family name, "Noto Sans CJK JP",
and the upstream copyright notice. Neither the upstream license text
(https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk/blob/main/Sans/LICENSE) nor the notice
in the font's own name table declares a Reserved Font Name, so the OFL's
restriction on reusing one does not apply.

ChordSketch's redistribution complies by retaining this NOTICE entry and by
shipping the OFL text in `crates/render-pdf/assets/OFL.txt` (inside the
`chordsketch-render-pdf` crate package) and in `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`
(inside the binary distributions named above).


===============================================================================
Web fonts — Inter, JetBrains Mono, Noto Sans JP, Roboto, Source Serif 4, Bravura Text
===============================================================================

The playground and documentation site (`packages/playground/`) serve Inter,
JetBrains Mono, Noto Sans JP, Roboto and Bravura Text from their own files,
bundled from the `@fontsource-variable/*` and `@fontsource/bravura-text` npm
packages at build time. The design-system reference pages (`design-system/`)
carry the Latin subsets of Inter, JetBrains Mono, Roboto, Source Serif 4 and
Bravura Text in `design-system/fonts/`. No page requests a font from a
third-party service.

  - Inter           Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors
                    (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
