                    (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
  - Noto Sans JP    Google Inc.
  - Roboto          Copyright 2011 The Roboto Project Authors
                    (https://github.com/googlefonts/roboto-classic)
  - Source Serif 4  Google Inc. (as the font package states it)
  - Bravura Text    Copyright © 2019, Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH
                    (http://www.steinberg.net/), with Reserved Font Name
                    "Bravura" (the same family as the Bravura entry above;
                    the files are unmodified)

All are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The license
